              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "...Thanks to that outlander's help, my research has been fast-tracked. I never would've believed that things would go so smoothly..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "...Next, I will travel to the southern shoals of Yashiori Island to test the effects of the medicine once more. This time, I will be using the full dose..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "...Whatever happens, I want to thank everyone for their help..."
